<title>USA: Delta Financial says to offer $150 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Delta Financial says to offer $150 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Financial Corp on Friday said it intends to offer $150 million of senior notes due 2004 via a Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp syndicate.</p>
<p>Delta said it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Delta Financial is a Woodbury, N.Y.-based specialty consumer finance company engaged in originating, acquiring, selling and servicing non-conforming home equity loans.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bonds, 212-859-1672))</p>
